WEBVTT

00:00:01.315 --> 00:00:13.159
Yes, I embraced tenderness and devotion
sou itooshisa to kizuna wo daita

00:00:13.327 --> 00:00:18.899
Floating in unending space
hatenaki umi ni ukabu

00:00:18.899 --> 00:00:25.805
On this small planet
chiisa na hoshi de

00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:37.342
When I feel your warmth next to me
anata no nukumori wo soba ni kanjiru toki

00:00:37.551 --> 00:00:43.490
I understand the burden
inochi no omosa to

00:00:43.490 --> 00:00:50.896
And the transience of life
hakanasa wo shiru no

00:00:53.633 --> 00:00:58.661
Nights of sorrowful wandering
mayoinageku yoru mo

00:00:58.705 --> 00:01:05.579
And tearful mornings
namida no asa mo

00:01:05.579 --> 00:01:11.142
I believe in tomorrow
ashita wo shinjiru kara

00:01:11.184 --> 00:01:17.424
So I can make it through
koeteyukeru no

00:01:17.424 --> 00:01:25.889
To the continuation of the dream
yume no tsuzuki he

00:01:38.512 --> 00:01:40.313
Professor Gherta?

00:01:40.313 --> 00:01:44.079
It's her... That woman scientist
from the GED Group.

00:01:52.492 --> 00:01:55.222
Gherta is Mel's reincarnation.

00:01:55.662 --> 00:01:59.029
She's the one who completed
the transference device.

00:02:06.673 --> 00:02:11.542
GHERTA

00:02:33.333 --> 00:02:35.324
What is that?!

00:02:37.003 --> 00:02:40.941
W-What should we do?!
Should we continue on like this?!

00:02:40.941 --> 00:02:42.841
Ask someone in the executive
management office!

00:02:50.784 --> 00:02:54.087
W-What are you doing?! Contact
the defense forces immediately!

00:02:54.087 --> 00:02:55.856
W-What?! You can't get through?

00:02:55.856 --> 00:02:57.691
The transmission signal was cut off?!

00:02:57.691 --> 00:02:59.559
What about the phones?!
The satellite connection too?!

00:02:59.559 --> 00:03:02.084
What country could that aircraft
have come from?

00:03:04.464 --> 00:03:07.865
In that case, send over some
personnel on an emergency boat!

00:03:18.612 --> 00:03:21.581
Aghi! This spaceship is from Greecia.

00:03:21.581 --> 00:03:24.141
Yes, it's Gueroca's ship!

00:03:25.018 --> 00:03:27.111
I didn't think it would be this big.

00:03:27.687 --> 00:03:29.587
Helga's body!

00:03:29.890 --> 00:03:31.725
At any rate, we have to
get to the center ring!

00:03:31.725 --> 00:03:33.326
As long as we stop that,

00:03:33.326 --> 00:03:34.995
neither the people from
Earth nor Gueroca

00:03:34.995 --> 00:03:37.555
will be able to make the
machine work! Let's go!

00:03:47.040 --> 00:03:48.337
Soreto!

00:03:48.608 --> 00:03:50.098
I'm okay!

00:03:50.944 --> 00:03:52.935
Look out, Soreto!

00:03:54.681 --> 00:03:56.649
Soreto!

00:04:03.256 --> 00:04:05.690
Everything will soon be over.

00:04:06.626 --> 00:04:08.287
Everything.

00:04:09.896 --> 00:04:11.693
First...

00:04:17.237 --> 00:04:19.000
Dumas?!

00:04:19.673 --> 00:04:22.107
Dumas!
What are you going to do?!

00:04:33.019 --> 00:04:36.352
S-Stop it, Dumas!
This isn't what we agreed to!

00:04:39.459 --> 00:04:41.927
I don't need improvements
made to the control mechanism!

00:04:44.497 --> 00:04:46.897
Though I didn't get
all of you together...

00:04:47.300 --> 00:04:49.069
What's happening?!

00:04:49.069 --> 00:04:51.196
We're being disconnected
from the ship!

00:04:51.705 --> 00:04:54.640
I will not let you people
go back to Greecia.

00:04:55.442 --> 00:04:57.910
Just as I have no place to go,

00:04:58.745 --> 00:05:02.977
all of you have no where
to go home to anymore!

00:05:05.118 --> 00:05:08.110
The capsules' monitoring systems
have been disconnected.

00:05:08.722 --> 00:05:11.919
You'll see your own
bodies decompose.

00:05:26.506 --> 00:05:28.997
This is my revenge.

00:05:35.782 --> 00:05:40.420
Damn it! Hey! If we don't get out of
here quick, we'll crash into the ocean!

00:05:40.420 --> 00:05:42.650
Wonder!

00:05:47.961 --> 00:05:49.829
Let's go, Tarlant.

00:05:49.829 --> 00:05:52.559
We have something that we
have to do no matter what!

00:05:54.768 --> 00:05:57.669
-Are you all right, Soreto?
-Yes, I'm fine.

00:05:57.871 --> 00:06:00.073
But we can't get close
to the ring.

00:06:00.073 --> 00:06:03.410
It's Dumas! He's using
the robots to guard it!

00:06:03.410 --> 00:06:06.106
I didn't think they'd
appear so quickly.

00:06:06.713 --> 00:06:08.374
What's wrong?

00:06:11.951 --> 00:06:14.254
-Wonder?!
-Why?

00:06:14.254 --> 00:06:16.085
It's Helga!

00:06:17.891 --> 00:06:20.519
Tarlant! He's not coming out!

00:06:21.194 --> 00:06:23.025
Hesma!

00:06:23.930 --> 00:06:27.200
-Hesma!
-He's not here! Hesma's not here!

00:06:27.200 --> 00:06:31.004
Hesma! He isn't anywhere!

00:06:31.004 --> 00:06:34.531
M-My body is... My body is...

00:06:36.543 --> 00:06:38.807
Hesma!

00:06:43.683 --> 00:06:45.418
Thoma!

00:06:45.418 --> 00:06:46.886
Hesma!

00:06:46.886 --> 00:06:50.287
My body! My body!

00:06:51.157 --> 00:06:53.226
Hesma! Hurry and
give me your hand!

00:06:53.226 --> 00:06:55.161
This is my body!

00:06:55.161 --> 00:06:58.221
What are you doing?!
Give me your hand!

00:07:09.576 --> 00:07:11.840
Do you want to die?

00:07:13.513 --> 00:07:17.005
If it comes down like this,
you're going to die!

00:07:17.951 --> 00:07:20.019
You guys don't understand!

00:07:20.019 --> 00:07:23.045
You don't understand
what death means!

00:07:23.289 --> 00:07:25.725
The way you guys have been
doing things up until now,

00:07:25.725 --> 00:07:27.693
it won't work anymore!

00:07:37.003 --> 00:07:39.130
Die?

00:07:39.639 --> 00:07:42.369
Give me your hand, Hesma!
Hurry!

00:07:49.282 --> 00:07:51.216
Thoma.

00:07:59.192 --> 00:08:00.716
Damn it!

00:08:02.295 --> 00:08:03.853
Hesma!

00:08:05.131 --> 00:08:07.224
Thoma!

00:08:08.535 --> 00:08:11.197
Hesma!

00:08:22.148 --> 00:08:25.140
-Hasmodye!
-Aghi!

00:08:53.680 --> 00:08:55.341
Hesma!

00:09:01.721 --> 00:09:03.780
Hesma...

00:09:06.192 --> 00:09:08.353
You have to hold on, Hesma!

00:09:09.128 --> 00:09:15.294
M-My body?
Where is my body?

00:09:16.302 --> 00:09:19.572
It's all right.
It isn't damaged.

00:09:19.572 --> 00:09:22.405
Your body is fine! Hesma!

00:09:24.043 --> 00:09:25.678
R-Really?

00:09:25.678 --> 00:09:31.184
A-Aghi... What about
everyone else's bodies?

00:09:31.184 --> 00:09:33.820
There are just some cracks
on the capsules.

00:09:33.820 --> 00:09:36.456
The preservation fluid
isn't leaking out.

00:09:36.456 --> 00:09:39.254
Hold on, Hesma.

00:09:40.526 --> 00:09:42.551
Thank goodness.

00:09:43.062 --> 00:09:47.600
So now, we can all
go home, right?

00:09:47.600 --> 00:09:51.696
Aghi... We can go home, right?

00:09:53.072 --> 00:09:54.630
Yes.

00:09:59.979 --> 00:10:04.916
This is Kirchner's data.
If you analyze it...

00:10:06.519 --> 00:10:11.081
You hold on to it.
It's your job!

00:10:14.594 --> 00:10:17.654
I can't see anymore...

00:10:18.197 --> 00:10:21.132
Am I going to die?

00:10:22.969 --> 00:10:27.565
And I won't wake up
as myself ever again?

00:10:32.612 --> 00:10:34.978
I want to go home.

00:10:36.215 --> 00:10:39.082
I wanted to go back home.

00:10:40.119 --> 00:10:43.987
To our homeworld, Greecia...

00:10:44.357 --> 00:10:46.587
Greecia...

00:10:56.102 --> 00:10:58.263
Hesma...

00:11:01.174 --> 00:11:02.075
Hesma!

00:11:02.075 --> 00:11:03.276
-Hesma!
-Hesma!

00:11:03.276 --> 00:11:05.506
Hesma...

00:12:08.875 --> 00:12:10.672
Dumas.

00:12:11.511 --> 00:12:13.843
Big Sister.

00:12:24.490 --> 00:12:26.583
Come, Big Sister.

00:12:26.926 --> 00:12:29.554
The time has come for you
to return to being Tina.

00:12:31.097 --> 00:12:32.832
Dumas.

00:12:32.832 --> 00:12:35.234
You're not like my uncle.

00:12:35.234 --> 00:12:38.670
I believe in you!

00:12:42.141 --> 00:12:43.665
Wonder...

00:13:33.559 --> 00:13:34.958
Aghi.

00:13:40.266 --> 00:13:41.927
Aghi.

00:13:42.368 --> 00:13:45.963
The person who made the transference
device here, Professor Gherta,

00:13:46.672 --> 00:13:48.537
is Mel.

00:13:51.878 --> 00:13:53.946
Dumas told us.

00:13:53.946 --> 00:13:57.074
He said that she's the
reincarnation of Mel.

00:13:57.750 --> 00:14:00.218
The reincarnation of Mel?

00:14:00.620 --> 00:14:04.681
He's known about it
for a long time now.

00:14:05.091 --> 00:14:08.822
I'd heard Professor Gherta had
deciphered the code from the Out Zone.

00:14:09.228 --> 00:14:11.958
And then there was Rugen's picture.

00:14:12.198 --> 00:14:13.597
Mel.

00:14:14.167 --> 00:14:16.101
Gherta.

00:14:20.540 --> 00:14:23.776
Aghi, look! The initial positioning
has been completed!

00:14:23.776 --> 00:14:26.176
Is that it? The machine
they're going to put Helga in?

00:14:27.346 --> 00:14:30.683
If we can get to the control room,
we can still stop it!

00:14:30.683 --> 00:14:34.983
If Gherta is Mel, if that is really is true,
I'll go and make her stop it!

00:14:35.988 --> 00:14:38.491
We have to hurry
and save Helga!

00:14:38.491 --> 00:14:42.028
I won't let them send Helga to
that Zone you were talking about!

00:14:42.028 --> 00:14:44.326
Wonder!

00:14:50.403 --> 00:14:52.735
This symbol...

00:14:53.339 --> 00:14:55.739
It was in Conrad Rugen's...

00:14:58.477 --> 00:15:00.446
No, that's not right!

00:15:00.446 --> 00:15:02.982
It's from somewhere else.

00:15:02.982 --> 00:15:04.973
Something...

00:15:06.085 --> 00:15:07.687
Professor!

00:15:07.687 --> 00:15:09.722
So this is where you've been!

00:15:09.722 --> 00:15:12.247
There's a problem!
Please come right away!

00:15:20.666 --> 00:15:22.531
Over there!

00:15:42.722 --> 00:15:44.917
-It's that girl!
-Yeah!

00:15:44.991 --> 00:15:48.394
Alice! If you don't want to get
killed by the robots, stay here!

00:15:48.394 --> 00:15:49.861
Cooks!

00:16:03.542 --> 00:16:06.012
W-What... What is that?

00:16:06.012 --> 00:16:09.379
I don't know! Anyway,
come to the control room!

00:16:17.523 --> 00:16:19.047
Mel!

00:16:19.792 --> 00:16:22.022
The Children of Befort.

00:16:22.261 --> 00:16:25.230
Is that your ship from Greecia?!

00:16:26.065 --> 00:16:29.000
You are our friend, Mel.

00:16:29.935 --> 00:16:31.404
What are you talking about?

00:16:31.404 --> 00:16:34.635
You alien! What are you
planning to do?!

00:16:36.742 --> 00:16:40.109
The scientist who discovered
x-rays, Conrad Rugen.

00:16:41.447 --> 00:16:46.218
Rugen is our friend, who
left us 159 years ago.

00:16:46.218 --> 00:16:48.209
Palza.

00:16:51.891 --> 00:16:56.385
And on Greecia, he was
your lover, Palza.

00:16:57.863 --> 00:16:59.865
Rugen...

00:16:59.865 --> 00:17:01.856
Palza?

00:17:05.871 --> 00:17:08.704
Please, Mel! Remember!

00:17:09.308 --> 00:17:12.436
This is your record! Watch!

00:17:26.826 --> 00:17:28.561
Look.

00:17:28.561 --> 00:17:30.830
The constellation shining
in the eastern sky

00:17:30.830 --> 00:17:33.032
and the constellation shining
in the western sky

00:17:33.032 --> 00:17:37.503
were once lovers who lived
in the land of the gods.

00:17:37.503 --> 00:17:41.707
One day, the lovers
angered the gods.

00:17:41.707 --> 00:17:44.301
They were separated and turned
into constellations in the heavens.

00:17:44.610 --> 00:17:47.980
And then, they were only allowed
to meet at this time of year.

00:17:47.980 --> 00:17:50.005
For just a fleeting moment.

00:17:50.850 --> 00:17:53.619
Palza, that's only a myth.

00:17:53.619 --> 00:17:57.646
We're going to get married
soon and be together forever.

00:17:57.990 --> 00:18:00.356
Mel...

00:18:04.363 --> 00:18:09.391
Those constellations probably
want to be together for all eternity.

00:18:12.838 --> 00:18:15.068
Palza...

00:18:22.882 --> 00:18:25.718
I want to stay here!

00:18:25.718 --> 00:18:28.354
I am Conrad Rugen!

00:18:28.354 --> 00:18:30.823
You coward! You traitor!

00:18:30.823 --> 00:18:33.917
What's going to happen to me
if you stay here?!

00:18:34.393 --> 00:18:36.725
I'm begging you, Palza!

00:18:37.329 --> 00:18:39.559
Good-bye, Conrad.

00:18:39.932 --> 00:18:42.230
Conrad Rugen.

00:18:51.444 --> 00:18:57.280
At that time, in order to meet
Palza at 25 years old...

00:18:57.583 --> 00:19:00.051
Mel!

00:19:00.753 --> 00:19:04.917
I left the rest of you, and made
a transference device by myself.

00:19:27.079 --> 00:19:29.570
That shard...

00:19:29.748 --> 00:19:34.583
I... It was something
I gave to Palza.

00:19:36.222 --> 00:19:38.588
Inside that shard...

00:19:39.792 --> 00:19:43.728
I put those separated
constellations together.

00:19:45.130 --> 00:19:49.260
So that I wouldn't lose
my bond with Palza.

00:19:56.275 --> 00:20:00.143
Palza... saw it.

00:20:00.412 --> 00:20:02.107
Palza...

00:20:12.825 --> 00:20:14.656
Mel.

00:20:17.062 --> 00:20:18.893
Mel.

00:20:21.634 --> 00:20:23.864
I'm sorry, Soreto.

00:20:24.737 --> 00:20:30.876
After that, I left Palza and
followed all of you.

00:20:30.876 --> 00:20:35.080
But the transfer was one year off.

00:20:35.080 --> 00:20:39.718
That's why my memories became
confused faster than the rest of you,

00:20:39.718 --> 00:20:42.186
and I was captured by Dumas.

00:20:44.523 --> 00:20:46.616
Dumas.

00:20:46.892 --> 00:20:51.659
I remember now.
Yes, that was...

00:20:52.731 --> 00:20:55.700
That memo was something I wrote.

00:20:56.669 --> 00:20:59.001
While he was threatening me,

00:20:59.572 --> 00:21:02.040
and I was in complete terror.

00:21:03.475 --> 00:21:05.340
Mel.

00:21:33.105 --> 00:21:34.902
It's him!

00:21:37.343 --> 00:21:38.811
Helga!

00:21:38.811 --> 00:21:40.779
Wonder!

00:21:43.949 --> 00:21:46.315
Helga!

00:21:47.353 --> 00:21:49.412
Thoma!

00:22:35.601 --> 00:22:45.408
At the bottom of the deep, clear sea
fukaku fukaku sukitooru umi no soko ni

00:22:45.678 --> 00:22:55.521
A small flower is resting
chiisana hana madoronderu

00:22:55.521 --> 00:23:00.292
The melody of a gentle wind
amayaka na kaze no shirabe

00:23:00.292 --> 00:23:05.127
Passes through a rainbow
niji wo kuguri

00:23:05.531 --> 00:23:14.667
The fish are playing in the sky
sakanatachi wa sora ni asobu

00:23:14.807 --> 00:23:19.845
Everyone plays the music of love
dare mo ga ai wo kanaderu

00:23:19.845 --> 00:23:25.117
A warm light came down
atatakana hikari futteta

00:23:25.117 --> 00:23:29.520
(A gaze) That gaze
(manazashi wa) sono manazashi wa

00:23:29.555 --> 00:23:33.859
Is unbound and becomes full
hodokete michiteku

00:23:33.859 --> 00:23:38.728
Embraced by water
mizu ni dakare
